    "created_at": "2016-05-03T09:54:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-03T09:54:59Z",
    "body": "I suspect we just want to do this in the-end; it would probably be simpler to have the spec say\n\n> 1. Queue a task to run the following substeps:\n>    1. Mark the Document as completely loaded.\n>    2. If the Document has a browsing context container that is an iframe element, run the iframe load event steps.\n>    3. If the Document has a browsing context container that is a frame element, fire a simple event named load at the frame element.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
